ick denuncia Dancer alla polizia come illegale tutore della bambina.","tagline":"Fate tutti attenzione! La più giovane truffatrice del mondo è in città."},{"language":"en-US","overview":"Bill is a penniless drifter who scams strangers out of just enough money to feed himself and his partner in crime, an orphan girl known as Curly Sue. Bill and Curly Sue target Grey, a yuppie lawyer, but their con takes an unexpected turn when the successful woman begins to like the ramshackle duo. But there's one problem—Grey's jealous, conniving boyfriend, Walker.","tagline":"A funny story about a family... And the little girl who started it."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/24ImbkqoOchQhNR9HGZ0Fes1u6F.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/b7nNVBVKjuuvyoxj7WFvddI1ML3.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":11894,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"en-US","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/24ImbkqoOchQhNR9HGZ0Fes1u6F.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/24ImbkqoOchQhNR9HGZ0Fes1u6F.jpg","language":"it","width":500,"height":750},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/24ImbkqoOchQhNR9HGZ0Fes1u6F.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/24ImbkqoOchQhNR9HGZ0Fes1u6F.jpg","language":"it","width":500,"height":750},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zY1kEz4kel1OJor7L73DvDeaXuv.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zY1kEz4kel1OJor7L73DvDeaXuv.jpg","language":"it","width":800,"height":1200}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cndkzlP5frVWxng5HLd4JvA2g2y.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/cndkzlP5frVWxng5HLd4JvA2g2y.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"h